  "id": "1",
  "notes": "## BitNet LLM Integration Workflow\n\nThis workflow provides comprehensive integration with the BitNet local LLM service:\n\n### Main Features:\n1. **Health Check**: Verifies BitNet service availability\n2. **Text Generation**: Sends prompts to BitNet for inference\n3. **Model Information**: Retrieves model metadata\n4. **Metrics Collection**: Collects Prometheus metrics\n\n### Usage:\n- Input: JSON with 'prompt' field\n- Output: Generated text with metadata\n- Error handling for service unavailability\n\n### Integration Points:\n- Solace Message VPN for event-driven triggers\n- Vault for secure API token management\n- Prometheus for monitoring and alerting",
  "notesInExecutionOrder": [
